<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An ongoing stream of an immortal entity's first person perspective titled &quot;LIFE SPEEDRUN 100% GLITCHLESS.&quot; . Every day during the stream, the entity in question does something seemingly random that hasn't been done before on the stream.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The narrative will be told through a series of logs recording what the anomaly is doing in the ongoing stream whilst a dispatched MTF team is using the information within the stream to locate and contain the SCP.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The immortal anomaly attempts to do literally everything life has to offer.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> N/A</p>

