<p>-J articles are the ones that rely most on a snap judgement; the joke doesn't, or at least shouldn't, rely on several minutes of contemplation or having the gag explained to you.</p>
<p>At the risk of showing myself as a bit of a clod, I don't get the joke beyond &quot;it looks like a dick + it takes your dick.&quot; It's not a funny joke so much as a motion in the direction of a joke. Maybe there's some subtle or subversive humor, but then if the joke has to be explained, it's not a good joke. -1</p>

