<p>I am OperatorEcho(or just Echo for short), I am a college student in the Philippines. I just recently re-discovered my curiosity in SCP because of the recent videos of TheRubber and the short film SCP Overlord. I am still exploring on the site on what to do but for now I am just reading up various SCPs.</p>
<p>My hobbies are drawing, gaming, reading, and cooking/baking. I am interested in science fiction, mystery, and military history. I listen to various music genres but mostly interested in rock music.</p>
<p>What kind of random thoughts keep you up at night?.. Embarrassing things in the past and imaginative drawing ideas that not all I can draw when I wake up.</p>
<p>I am so excited to be here! I will be enjoying to explore the SCP universe.</p>

